Z||000000||Sootah||10-17-2001||07:19 PM||||As all of you should know from my numerous and rather vocal threads by now, I've thrown a rod in my sexy-ass black 85 GT. I just got off of the phone to a salvage yard in a close town and it turns out they have a running 86 GT there. Black even. There is a slight possibility that I will be able to trade in my 85 GT for the 86 (and give him some $$ as well, of course). But how would one go about getting a title for this? That is the big question here, I don't know what to do if he can't aqquire one.<P>Nothing definate yet as I havent even seen the car. Once again it sounds too good to be true. (And we all know what happened last time I jumped on a freakishly good deal..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> )<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sootah__Nuclear_Happy_Face_Sig.jpg">      <BR><sup><I>Never pull your pants down in Cosco, the dang monkeys will getcha</I></sup> <BR><sup><B>AIM</B>: KSSouter</sup><p>[This message has been edited by Sootah (edited 10-17-2001).]||||reg||1
