Z||000003||JohnF||10-17-2001||07:30 PM||||The JY will get you a title!  There are several ways that can be done.  If they have been in businees more than a month, they know what is possible and what isn't!  <P>My only advice is be VERY, VERY careful that you have the ability to get this car in YOUR name, before you spend ANY money on it (including buying it)!<P>Remember the old saying - If it is too good to be true, it probably is!||||reg||1
