Z||000005||85 gt fiero||10-17-2001||08:36 PM||||i think you can call the state police and they come out to do an inspection and if it passes they will sign a relief form and then they can write a slip and send you off to the dmv for a "rebuilt title".  At least thats what they do in michigan.    Randy <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>RALLY CAR, FULL ROLL CAGE, SKID PLATES AND SOON TO BE BRIGHT YELLOW||||reg||12
